## Coverage

For requests covering a set of records, completion requires processing that set; one successful page is not completion.
For WootQL, continue while next_offset is not #f, or use query-map to consume every page.
For search and related, continue while next_cursor is not #f.
Read-only pagination within the original request needs no new permission. If an explicit user limit, exhausted budget, or unresolved blocker
prevents completion, stop and clearly report partial coverage and the reason. Never silently substitute a sample or act on unverified records.
